---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Nicholas.K — Growth & Partnerships Advisor">
  <Header />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-primary via-dark to-primary pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40 md:pb-28">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
      <div class="absolute top-20 left-10 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-secondary blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-10 right-10 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-accent blur-3xl"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Growth & Partnerships Advisor</p>
        <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          17 Years Building Spotify's Growth Engine.
          <span class="text-accent"> Now I Work With You.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          I joined Spotify in 2009 as one of its early employees. Over the next 17 years, I led the partnerships, payment ecosystems, and global distribution networks that helped scale Spotify from a Nordic startup to a product loved by hundreds of millions. Now I bring that playbook to ambitious businesses ready to unlock their next stage of growth.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-primary transition-all hover:bg-accent/90 hover:shadow-xl">
            Book a Free Consultation
          </a>
          <a href="/services" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-gray-500 px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-all hover:border-white hover:bg-white/5">
            Explore Services
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trust Bar -->
  <section class="border-b border-gray-200 bg-white py-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-8 md:gap-16 text-sm text-muted">
        <div class="text-center">
          <span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">17</span>
          Years at Spotify
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">13+</span>
          Markets Expanded
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">60%+</span>
          YoY Growth Delivered
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">2x</span>
          Sales in B2B Retail
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What I Do -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary mb-3">What I Do</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-primary md:text-4xl">
          Strategic Advisory That Drives Results
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
          From building your first partner relationships to designing the infrastructure that makes global distribution possible, I bring the hands-on experience of having done it inside one of the world's most competitive growth companies.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="group rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8 transition-all hover:border-secondary hover:shadow-lg">
          <div class="mb-5 inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-secondary/10 text-secondary">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-primary mb-3">Growth Strategy</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Data-driven growth frameworks built on real-world experience — not theory. I help you identify untapped channels, optimise your monetisation model, and build repeatable revenue engines that scale.
          </p>
          <a href="/services" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-secondary hover:text-secondary/80 transition-colors">
            Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="group rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8 transition-all hover:border-secondary hover:shadow-lg">
          <div class="mb-5 inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent/10 text-accent">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-primary mb-3">Partnership Development</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
            I've negotiated and closed deals with banks, retailers, and payment providers across Europe, the US, and beyond. I help you identify the right partners, structure the right deals, and build a distribution ecosystem that multiplies your reach.
          </p>
          <a href="/services" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-secondary hover:text-secondary/80 transition-colors">
            Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="group rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8 transition-all hover:border-secondary hover:shadow-lg">
          <div class="mb-5 inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-primary mb-3">Payments & Distribution Strategy</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Getting your product into users' hands — through the right channels and with the right payment infrastructure — is often the most overlooked growth lever. I help you design and execute it.
          </p>
          <a href="/services" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-secondary hover:text-secondary/80 transition-colors">
            Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Work With Me -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary mb-3">Why Nicholas.K</p>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-primary md:text-4xl">
            A Partner Who Has Done It at Scale
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
            I don't advise from the sidelines. I've spent 17 years inside Spotify executing the exact type of work I now help businesses with — building partnerships from scratch, negotiating global deals, and turning distribution into a competitive advantage.
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-white text-xs">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Launched Spotify's first prepaid product in the Nordics in 2009 — the foundation for their global PAYG ecosystem</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-white text-xs">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Led the global rollout of Spotify's gift card business across 13+ markets, achieving 60%+ YoY revenue growth</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-white text-xs">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Negotiated Spotify Premium distribution through Sweden's largest bank — opening an entirely new subscriber acquisition channel</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-white text-xs">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Deep network across retail, fintech, streaming, and digital media</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-white text-xs">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Outcome-focused — every engagement is tied to measurable results</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary text-white text-xs">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Flexible engagements — from focused strategy sprints to ongoing advisory</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/about" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-secondary hover:text-secondary/80 transition-colors">
            More about me <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="aspect-square rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 to-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <div class="text-center p-8">
              <div class="inline-flex h-24 w-24 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-accent font-heading text-4xl font-bold mb-4">NK</div>
              <p class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-primary">Nicholas K</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">Growth & Partnerships Advisor</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Success Stories -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary mb-3">Success Stories</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-primary md:text-4xl">Real Results, From the Inside Out</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Everything I now advise on is grounded in work I've actually done — at scale, with real stakes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary mb-3">Global Distribution · Spotify</p>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">Taking Spotify's Gift Card Business from Zero to 13+ Markets</h3>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
            <p><strong class="text-gray-700">The challenge:</strong> Spotify needed to reach users who couldn't or wouldn't pay via digital wallets or credit cards — particularly across markets with lower card penetration.</p>
            <p><strong class="text-gray-700">What I did:</strong> I led the end-to-end global rollout of Spotify's gift card business — identifying and negotiating distribution partnerships with key retail partners, structuring deals, and scaling across Europe, the US, Mexico, and Australia.</p>
            <p><strong class="text-gray-700">The result:</strong> The gift card business scaled to 13+ markets, achieving over 60% year-on-year revenue growth.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary mb-3">Prepaid & Payments · Spotify</p>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">Launching Spotify's First Prepaid Product — and Laying the Foundation for a Global Ecosystem</h3>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
            <p><strong class="text-gray-700">The challenge:</strong> In 2009, converting free Nordic users to paid subscribers required more than a credit card checkout. Spotify needed a new payment channel that met users where they already were.</p>
            <p><strong class="text-gray-700">What I did:</strong> I launched Spotify's first prepaid product in Sweden and Norway through a partnership with the Reitan Group — the operator behind 7-Eleven, Pressbyrån, and Narvesen across the Nordics.</p>
            <p><strong class="text-gray-700">The result:</strong> The initiative became the foundation for Spotify's entire global PAYG and prepaid ecosystem — a model critical to the company's global expansion.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary mb-3">Strategic Partnerships · Spotify</p>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">Launching Spotify Premium Through Sweden's Largest Bank</h3>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
            <p><strong class="text-gray-700">The challenge:</strong> Spotify needed to move Premium subscription sales beyond direct digital channels and into mainstream consumer touchpoints.</p>
            <p><strong class="text-gray-700">What I did:</strong> I negotiated and closed a partnership that launched Spotify Premium through Sweden's largest bank — creating a new institutional distribution channel for the subscription product.</p>
            <p><strong class="text-gray-700">The result:</strong> Opened a high-trust acquisition channel through an established financial brand, driving Premium subscriber growth through a partner with millions of existing consumers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary mb-3">B2B Distribution · British American Tobacco</p>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">Building Sweden's First National Retail Incentive Programme</h3>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
            <p><strong class="text-gray-700">The challenge:</strong> BAT Sweden had no standardised way to incentivise and align its retail partners across the country. Sales performance was inconsistent and product visibility varied widely.</p>
            <p><strong class="text-gray-700">What I did:</strong> I designed and launched Sweden's first national B2B retail incentive programme from scratch — structuring the mechanics, negotiating buy-in, and executing the rollout. The programme was adopted as BAT Sweden's official retail programme.</p>
            <p><strong class="text-gray-700">The result:</strong> Sales doubled across the channel. The programme became the blueprint BAT Sweden used going forward.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-secondary to-primary py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-white md:text-4xl">
        Ready to Build Your Growth Engine?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Let's talk about where your biggest opportunities are. Book a free 30-minute call — no pitch, no pressure.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-primary transition-all hover:bg-accent/90 hover:shadow-xl">
        Schedule Your Free Call
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
